# Kebu Mail

Full spec: `docs/product/KEBU-MAIL.md`

**NOT STARTED** until explicitly assigned. Do not ship fake inbox UI or simulated send.

## Law

- **Kebu Identity + Mail** — not “Kebu Gmail”
- **Real** send/receive interoperable with Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo, internet mail
- **Provider abstraction** — do not build raw SMTP/MX stack in v1
- Personal `@kebu.africa` — **FREE** (target)
- Business mail on **verified domains** — RBAC, shared mailboxes, audit
- **One Kebu Account** — switch mailbox context, not new login
- End-to-end slice: UI → API → provider → DB → inbound webhook → inbox → refresh

## Cursor (when assigned)

Provider adapter first. No fake sending. Replaceable infrastructure. One slice at a time.
